{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How do you imagine the world of the future?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Lethal Grace, large corporations rule the world. Androids have long been part of society, and it is impossible to distinguish them from humans\u2014except for their artificial eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Grace, an android girl and hired assassin working for one of the most influential corporations. Your task is to find and eliminate targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic first-person shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your abilities: run on walls, slow down time, use a shield, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment is destructible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lively and intense shootouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exciting and dramatic storyline.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4118480?t=1766767649","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118480/ddeec0523106225d6fdad8f8bb7dc08e5f1b968b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766767649","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118480/8bf04da048fa79caaa77b0d6d286f80059c02100/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766767649","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118480/8bf04da048fa79caaa77b0d6d286f80059c02100/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766767649","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Our game will feature partial nudity of female characters, as well as brutal enemy killings, blood, and body parts."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How do you imagi